 "headline": "MONSTARS Lean On Barnes While Brooks Vanishes",
 "notes": [
  "White Mambas just snatched DREB from Adam Silver Dez Nuts, because Bam Adebayo's 25 points came with the boards Quickley's owner needed.",
  "Scottie Barnes has 30 points on 11-18 shooting for MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f, the best line in the building, and Thug Life still hasn't blinked.",
  "Dillon Brooks has an empty line so far for BrookynDynasty, who leads 8-3 anyway, which is the kind of luck that ends friendships.",
  "LeParth James started Ja'Kobe Walter, who is 0-6 from the field, and somehow still leads Nova Knicks 6-5 with only OREB swinging.",
  "Jalen Green is 0-2 for MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f, which makes him the quietest guy on a roster where Barnes and Jalen Johnson are doing the work."
 ],
